WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.794
It is quarter to nine. School time.

2
00:00:03.864 --> 00:00:07.435
<v Dev>Dev: Look from the street. Too many cars! We cannot cross.

3
00:00:07.505 --> 00:00:11.360
<v Florence>Florence: Oops. Nobody said how. So I guessed that everyone drives.

4
00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:14.998
<v Posy>Posy: Safe paths for walking and cycling. Cars stay at the edge.

5
00:00:15.068 --> 00:00:18.475
<v Florence>Florence: Paths and cycle lanes. Cars at the edge. Checked!

6
00:00:18.545 --> 00:00:22.241
A town you can walk and cycle around is safer for everyone.

7
00:00:22.311 --> 00:00:27.073
And when your words leave a gap, an AI fills it with a guess. So say who you mean.
